Description: Pure-Rust Wayland desktop environment powered by Smithay & Iced
 Corten Desktop is a lightweight, memory-safe Wayland desktop environment
 written in 100% Rust. It supports Floating, Master-Stack, Dwindle, BSP,
 Monocle, and Niri-style Scrollable Tiling layouts, XDG Desktop Portals,
 per-application PipeWire audio routing, and optional local AURA-CORE AI.

